# The control of unit_decl_one_value_call_tail_refused with the call spelled `make: 3`, the short form `f: a b` of
# docs/LMX_grammar.en.md: one value, as `make(3)`. Success is 7, read through m.
Model:
    int: value 7
end: Model
fn: make (int: k) @: Model
    return: Model
end: make
fn: check () int
    @: Model m make: 3
    return: m\value
end: check
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: check(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
